"_: NAME OF TRANSLATORS\n"
"Your names"
msgstr "Samir Maric"

#: _translatorinfo.cpp:3
msgid ""
"_: EMAIL OF TRANSLATORS\n"
"Your emails"
msgstr "samir_maric@yahoo.se"

#: rc.cpp:1
msgid "Form2"
msgstr "Formular2"

#: rc.cpp:2
msgid "<b>Unable to contact the KDE smartcard service!</b>"
msgstr "<b>Ne mogu da kontaktiram KDE smartcard uslugu!</b>"

#: rc.cpp:3
msgid "Possible Reasons"
msgstr "Mogući razlozi"

#: rc.cpp:4
msgid ""
"\n"
"1) The KDE daemon, 'kded' is not running. You can restart it by running the "
"command 'kdeinit' and then try reloading the KDE Control Center to see if "
"this message goes away.\n"
"\n"
"2) You don't appear to have smartcard support in the KDE libraries. You will "
"need to recompile the kdelibs package with libpcsclite installed."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"1) KDE dimon, 'kded' nije pokrenut. Možete ga startovati uz pomoć komande "
"'kdeinit' i onda pokušati da ponovo pokrenete KDE kontrolni centar da "
"provjerite da li je ova poruka nestala.\n"
"\n"
"2) Izgleda da nemate podršku za smartcard u kde bibliotekama. Moraćete "
"ponovo kompilirati kdelibs paket sa instaliranim libpcsclite."

#: rc.cpp:5
msgid "SmartcardBase"
msgstr "SmartcardBase"

#: rc.cpp:6
msgid "Tab 1"
msgstr "Tab 1"

#: rc.cpp:7
msgid "&Enable smartcard support"
msgstr "&Uključi smartcard podršku"

#: rc.cpp:8
msgid "Enable &polling to autodetect card events"
msgstr "Uključi &polling za automatsku detekciju događaja s kartom"

#: rc.cpp:9
msgid ""
"In most cases you should have this enabled. It allows KDE to automatically "
"detect card insertion and reader hotplug events."
msgstr ""
"U većini slučajeva trebali bi ste ovo uključiti. To omogućuje da KDE "
"automatski otkrije karticu i hotplug događaje sa čitačom."

#: rc.cpp:10
msgid "Automatically &launch card manager if inserted card is unclaimed"
msgstr "Automatski pokreni &menadžera karte ako je ubačena kartica neprepoznata"

#: rc.cpp:11
msgid ""
"When you insert a smartcard, KDE can automatically launch a management tool "
"if no other application attempts to use the card."
msgstr ""
"Kada ubacite smartcard KDE može automatski pokrenuti alat za menadžment "
"ako nijedan drugi program nije pokušao da koristi karticu."

#: rc.cpp:12
msgid "&Beep on card insert and removal"
msgstr "&Pisak pri ubacivanju i vađenju kartice"

#: rc.cpp:13
msgid "Tab 2"
msgstr "Tab 2"

#: rc.cpp:14
msgid "PCSCLite configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguracija PCSCLite"

#: rc.cpp:15
msgid ""
"To add new readers you have to modify /etc/readers.conf file and re-start "
"pcscd"
msgstr ""
"Da bi ste dodali nove čitače morate promijeniti /etc/readers.conf datoteku "
"i ponovo pokrenuti pcscd"

#: rc.cpp:16
msgid "Slot name"
msgstr "Ime slota"

#: rc.cpp:17
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Vrsta"

#: rc.cpp:18
msgid "SubType"
msgstr "Podvrsta"

#: rc.cpp:19
msgid "SubsubType"
msgstr "pod-podvrsta"

#: smartcard.cpp:65
msgid "Change module"
msgstr "Promjeni modul"

#: smartcard.cpp:106
msgid "Unable to launch KCardChooser"
msgstr "Ne mogu da pokrenem KCardChooser"

#: smartcard.cpp:146
msgid "Smart card support disabled"
msgstr "Podrška za smartcard isključena"

#: smartcard.cpp:161
msgid "No readers found.Check 'pcscd' is running"
msgstr "Nema nijednog čitača.Provjerite da li je 'pcscd' pokrenut"

#: smartcard.cpp:184
msgid "No card inserted"
msgstr "Nema nijedne kartice"

#: smartcard.cpp:196
msgid "Managed by: "
msgstr "Kontrolisan od:"

#: smartcard.cpp:206
msgid "No module managing this card"
msgstr "Nijedan modul ne kontroliše ovu karticu"

#: smartcard.cpp:274
msgid ""
"<h1>smartcard</h1> This module allows you to configure KDE support for "
"smartcards. These can be used for various tasks such as storing SSL "
"certificates and logging in to the system."
msgstr ""
"<h1>smartcard</h1> Ovaj modul vam omogućuje da podesite KDE podršku za "
"smartcards. Ove kartice mogu biti korištene u razne svrhe kao npr. čuvanje "
"SSL certifikata i logovanje na sistem."

#: smartcard.cpp:283
msgid "kcmsmartcard"
msgstr "kcmsmartcard"

#: smartcard.cpp:283
msgid "KDE Smartcard Control Module"
msgstr "KDE Smartcard kontrolni modul"

